OL,3,GNEWSAMaritime museum wins award for
OL,4,A#20m renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum celebrating a city's seafaring
OL,7,Fhistory has won an award following a
OL,8,Fmajor renovation.
OL,10,FHull Maritime Museum was named
OL,11,FRefurbishment/Renovation Of The Year at
OL,12,Fthe Insider Yorkshire Property Awards
OL,13,F2026.
OL,15,FThe site reopened in August following
OL,16,F#20m of work.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
