OL,3,GNEWSAMaritime museum wins award for
OL,4,A#20m renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Ross, the leader of Hull City
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "The project has
OL,8,Fbreathed new life into one of Hull's
OL,9,Fmost important historic buildings,
OL,10,Fensuring its future while creating an
OL,11,Foutstanding visitor experience that
OL,12,Fcelebrates our city's world-famous
OL,13,Fmaritime heritage."
